########## Data that is not "my" data. ##############

*brca_tcga_pan_can_atlas_2018*
# The source is: 
# brca_tcga_pan_can_atlas_2018, containing TCGA files on breast cancer
# I used the between-sample-normalized RNA sequencing counts in data_RNA_Seq_v2_expression_median.txt
# and metadata on molecular subtypes in data_clinical_patient.txt
# Origin is https://www.cbioportal.org/datasets Breast Invasive Carcinoma (TCGA, PanCancer Atlas) with reference TCGA, Cell 2018 downloaded on 8-4-2021

*Ensmbl2Reactome.txt
*Ensembl2Reactome_All_Levels.txt
# The source is:
# Reactome, from https://reactome.org/download-data downloaded on 20-01-2025
# And the Zenodo release v91 from Dec 2024 https://zenodo.org/records/14518331 downloaded on 20-01-2025

*RNAseq_log2normalized_counts_celllines.csv
*RNAseq_raw_counts_celllines.csv
# The source is:
# Koedoot et al. 2021 (PMID:33790333). 
# I removed MDA-MB-435s since it is not a breast cancer cell line, normalized the data using DSeq2 and log2 transformed it.